 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<a href=\"http://bit.ly/2VcUX0q\" data-kind=\"affiliate\"><img src=\"@img:images/norfolk_AWEB.jpg\" alt=\"Minelab equinox update and what features does it have, looking at the new equinox update\" title=\"what is latest minelab equinox update\" width=\"457\" height=\"257\"></a>"
  },
  {
   "t": "h2",
   "html": "The latest Minelab Equinox firmware Update"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "is released by Minelab For the Equinox 800 and 600 series metal detectors"
  },
  {
   "t": "h3",
   "html": "Whats new in this update?",
   "inferred": true
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Better target I.D on bottlecaps, Rusty nails and other targets giving a positive false target id."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "The IRON BIAS has been updated with an extra set of iron bias settings F2.. which has the ability to identify a wider range of difficult iron targets which include BOTTLE Caps."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Also The Equinox 600 has a much needed improvement to the BACKLIGHT Function which allows a lower setting for low light conditions.."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "We have started to test out the new UPDATE to find the most useable settings without affecting performance, it may happen quickly or it may take a few weeks testing and changing setting to get optimal performance."
  },
  {
   "t": "h3",
   "html": "We note that some people have already found the best settings?? Really??",
   "inferred": true
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Some people are having difficulty working out what settings to use and saying they are finding more iron than before the update."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Instead of using Mr Billy Bobs Find it all settings with regard to where you are detecting.. just have a play in the garden with some buried targets and change settings to see what happen to the responce.."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Here is a video of the 1st day of trials on BEACH and LAND, the beach has a lot of buried iron so this location is a great place for testing although Paul Has the 15\" coil fitted.."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "watch the vidoe"
  },
  {
   "t": "video",
   "id": "zMEnKwjsUvU",
   "title": ""
  }
